<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px 0 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', height: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>认知副驾 · 功能汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>2026-11-11</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 14 }}>微信读书：让划过的线回到自己的库</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, width: 1160, height: 246, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 10, padding: 1 }}>
        <Table
            style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}
            defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 17, textAlign: 'left', color: '#334155' }}
            defaultCellStyle={{ border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E2E8F0' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#E2E8F0' } }, background: { color: '#FFFFFF' } }}
            cells={[
                [
                    { text: '微信读书里的内容', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4F46E5' } } },
                    { text: '落成什么', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4F46E5' } } },
                    { text: '标签', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4F46E5' } } },
                ],
                ['划线', '一条知识（划线原文）', { text: '微信读书 / 划线', textStyle: { color: '#4F46E5' } }],
                ['带划线的想法', '一条知识（原文 +【我的想法】）', { text: '微信读书 / 读书笔记', textStyle: { color: '#4F46E5' } }],
                ['整本书评、章节点评', '一条知识（想法本身）', { text: '微信读书 / 书评', textStyle: { color: '#4F46E5' } }],
            ]}
        />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, marginTop: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937' }}>幂等</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                按内容 id 去重，反复同步不会重复；你自己删掉的条目也不会被同步复活
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937' }}>可追溯</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                每条都带书名、章节、位置与原文链接，能跳回微信读书核对
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937' }}>有上限</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                单次最多扫描 300 条；没扫完会提示还剩几本，再点一次继续
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 62, background: '#EEF2FF', borderRadius: 10, marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            真正的重点是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4F46E5' }}>格式同构</span>：同步来的划线与手写知识同等对待，才会被 L1 捞出来、被 L2 拿去比对
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 20, right: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
